A package whose one file holds a package clause and its comment and declares
nothing, which no import reaches, beside the main package of the program and a
package the main package imports whose one file declares nothing either.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27.0
-- main.go --
package main

import _ "example.com/app/internal/imported"

func main() {}
-- internal/imported/doc.go --
// Package imported is reached by the main package's blank import.
package imported
-- internal/docs/doc.go --
// Package docs declares nothing and nothing imports it.
package docs
